WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:01.650
g.

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:07.750
One of the things we wonder about is does
Donald Trump know he lost and he's pretending

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:12.420
to have one for optics or to keep raising
money from his followers?

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:17.410
Or does he actually think he is the rightful
winner of the twenty twenty presidential election?

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:20.480
I actually believe that may be the wrong question.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:24.990
People like Donald Trump, narcissists with
delusions of grandeur and a complete inability

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:26.640
to self reflect.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:31.640
They hold contradictory beliefs at the same
time, or sometimes they switch or radically

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:35.750
every 30 seconds between one belief and its
opposite.

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:40.860
CNN is now reporting that Donald Trump has
told some advisers that he is simply going

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:47.690
to refuse to physically leave the White House
on Joe Biden's inauguration day, January 20th.

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:53.160
Aides report being alarmed by Donald Trump,
saying, I'm just not leaving because, as you

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:58.540
can imagine, Secret Service escorting a president
out of the White House would be fascinating,

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:02.020
but it would not exactly do wonders for Donald
Trump's legacy.

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:07.510
But then after saying I'm not leaving, Trump
reportedly kind of walks it back and starts

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:12.240
talking about who he wants to pardon on the
way out and looking forward to just heading

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:16.970
down to Florida, seemingly recognizing that
he did lose and he will leave.

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:19.170
Now, I'm not surprised by this.

00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:23.100
The discussion about does Trump know he lost
or not?

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:24.100
This is exactly.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:27.840
The type of thing I would expect where one
second he's insisting I'm not going to leave

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:32.610
because I won and the next second he's talking
about, screw this, I'm out of here, I'll go

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:36.050
play golf, give me a list of pardons to sign
off on.

00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:40.540
There's nothing at all shocking or unusual
about that for someone of Trump's personality

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:41.960
and disposition.

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:47.380
The other funny thing is that at this point,
I believe that most of the people convinced

