00:02:44.909 --> 00:02:47.540
You know, you should really be there on January
20th.

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:48.639
I don't know.

00:02:48.639 --> 00:02:50.459
There would be nothing better for ratings.

00:02:50.459 --> 00:02:52.290
There would be nothing better for shock value.

